 "summary_en": "There is no public sign that Ekhva or HUS is running or planning a chart audit of lung cancer patients with no treatment on record. FICAN, THL and the Cancer Registry are running a national research project in 2024–2027 that tests how far national registries can show what cancer care was given. The Cancer Registry's lung cancer report says stage at diagnosis is missing for nearly half of new patients, and most often in Eastern Finland. That documents the recording problem this audit targets.",
 "unanswered_en": "I found no Ekhva or HUS page about checking or fixing how cancer treatments are coded, and I did not read the HUS lung cancer care pathway page.",
